  "caption": "Across two hypotheses, that structural shift is hypothesized to drive two organellar choke points. Under H2, impaired NHE6 proton-leak regulation traps ApoER2 and LRP1 receptors in early endosomes. Under H5, ABCA1 and NPC1 lipid-export defects sequester cholesterol in lysosomes, elevating lysosomal pH and blunting beta-amyloid clearance.",
